message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below. All outputs are SYNTHETIC; flip means reversed channel order; 1024 means two noisy banks on the same 512 inputs—not 1024 independent channels, not a biological membrane, and not a quantum model."
title: "flip-observer-1024: synthetic classical channel-reversal observer calibration prototype (512 inputs, two noisy banks)"
