abstract: >-
  Deterministic offline Python prototype for an ordinary classical weighted
  readout under a hidden channel-order reversal. Uses 512 dimensionless
  synthetic input channels; the 1,024-slot layout is two noisy banks on the
  same 512 underlying signals (repeated measurement capacity, not 1,024
  independent latent channels). Calibration compares only identity versus
  exact reversal using known orthogonal full-channel patterns. SYNTHETIC
  evidence only. Not a physical observer, membrane model, quantum superposition
  or entanglement demo, medical device, or communications product.
